title: Go to Schaumburg-Lippe
new-page: true
is-special: true
face-image: img/land/Schaumburg-Lippe.svg.webp
on-arrival: {!
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById('schaum_lippe');
    if (!el || typeof d3 === 'undefined' || !window.ParliamentData) return;
    el.removeAttribute('data-parliament');
    el.innerHTML = '';
    window.ParliamentData.renderParliament('schaum_lippe', el);
  }, 0);
!}

= Schaumburg-Lippe

Schaumburg-Lippe is the smallest state in the Reich, yet we are a major political force.

Historical Note: This state is so poorly documented that it is sometimes hard to tell how and why things happened - you can't even really know who was part of what party precisely.
  
Currently ruled by [+ schaum_lippe_mp +] ([+ schaum_lippe_mp_party +]) in a [+ schaum_lippe_gov +] Coalition with [+ schaum_lippe_coalition_r +]% support.


<div id="baden" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>






- @coalition_schaum: Coalition
- @toleration_schaum: Toleration
- @policies_schaum: Policies
- @states: Exit Schaumburg-Lippe


@coalition_schaum
choose-if: schaum_lippe_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are not part of the Coalition

@toleration_schaum
choose-if: schaum_lippe_spd == 2
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in toleration

@policies_schaum
choose-if: schaum_lippe_spd == 1 and schaum_lippe_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not schaum_lippe_spd == 1: We are not part of the Coalition. ?][? if schaum_lippe_spd == 1 and schaum_lippe_action_timer > 0: We have to wait [+ schaum_lippe_action_timer +] months before our next action. ?]


- @prussian_schaum
- @prussia_is_schaum
- @dvp_schaum
- @dnvp_schaum


@prussian_schaum
title: Work towards a referendum on joining Prussia
subtitle: This state needs to be abolished
view-if: schaum_prussia < 5
on-arrival: schaum_lippe_action_timer += 10; schaum_prussia += 1


@prussia_is_schaum
title: Hold a referndum on joining Prussia
subtitle: May we do our best...
view-if: schaum_prussia >= 5
on-arrival: schaum_lippe_action_timer += 12; schaum_prussia = 0; dnvp_relation -= 1

The referndum fails, back to black...


@dvp_schaum
title: Improve relations with the <span style="color: [+ dvp_colour +];">**DVP**</span>
subtitle: Why not?
choose-if: schaum_lippe_dvp == 1 and schaum_lippe_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need to be in a coalition with them
on-arrival: schaum_lippe_action_timer += 11; dvp_relation += 2


@dnvp_schaum
title: Improve relations with the <span style="color: [+ dnvp_colour +];">**DNVP**</span>
subtitle: Why not?
choose-if: schaum_lippe_dnvp == 1 and schaum_lippe_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We need to be in a coalition with them
on-arrival: schaum_lippe_action_timer += 18; dnvp_relation += 1












  
